# Operations reference

## Local preview

- Portal: `http://localhost:3000`
- Admin: `http://localhost:3002`
- API: `http://localhost:3001`
- Stripe: `stripe listen --forward-to http://localhost:3001/webhooks/stripe`

Use `pnpm typecheck` for code validation. Use the human `README.md` for full
Firebase, Storage CORS, AWS/Serverless, Amplify, and production setup steps.

## Release guardrails

Name the environment before any cloud command. Verify rules, indexes, exact
CORS origins, webhook secrets, WAF/IAM/alarms, and required variables without
printing their values. Require approval before Firebase deploy, `gsutil`,
Serverless, Amplify, DNS, or credential changes.
